-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY DATA, IDENTIFIERS, MODELS AND CODE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BioBenchShift analyses reference public or externally maintained resources such
as BioSNAP/TargetDecagon, HuRI, Hetionet, BioGRID, ChEMBL, UniProt, PubChem,
and third-party model architectures/checkpoints. Those materials remain subject
to the licenses, terms, and citation requirements of their original providers.
This repository does not grant additional rights to third-party content.

Where practical, BioBenchShift records release identifiers, source locations,
checksums, and deterministic retrieval/processing logic rather than republishing
third-party datasets. See DATA_PROVENANCE.md and protocols/BENCHMARK_MANIFEST.md.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RESEARCH-USE BOUNDARY
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BioBenchShift is a research reproducibility package. Its outputs are not medical
advice, are not clinical safety determinations, and do not authorize treatment,
prescribing, diagnostic, or experimental decisions without independent domain-
appropriate validation.